            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "content": {
                "en": "(No point overthinking it. Let’s try talking to them.)",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 603.3333740234375,
            "positionY": 365.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0e6cd887-5e6b-4094-a8eb-3df7424ccb9d",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’ve never seen a puppet like that before. May I ask where you got it?",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 950.6666870117188,
            "positionY": 365.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9d8e9aa0-93c7-47e4-84ee-403380b91ade",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "0d2edd26-5554-47f2-b61f-99a5a0caf64b",
            "content": {
                "en": "Someone gave it to me! I took it with me before we left for the trip!",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1334.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 365.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6077de95-3faf-40c1-8263-bfda71bacda2",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "318c68cb-5927-41a5-91bd-bf8aa614ee91",
            "content": {
                "en": "Make sure you keep it safe this time. Don’t forget it at the hotel again.",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1685.333251953125,
            "positionY": 365.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0511f7d5-4333-4cf8-8256-d26983c47fe3",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sigh… I really didn’t want him to take that puppet. Those people in cloaks were just too weird.",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2015.333251953125,
            "positionY": 365.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c7a4d7ad-5d3c-41ef-af79-688a912ca11d",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "content": {
                "en": "People in cloaks?",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2359.33349609375,
            "positionY": 361.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a11f855e-87e6-4c47-badf-3bcfd8ba12cf",
            "index": 40,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yeah, maybe starting about half a month ago, there were folks showing up in Yuntai calling themselves the “Troupe Elysium.”",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2702.0,
            "positionY": 361.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1d0d0961-82d0-4e36-b01f-3fa69aba6fa0",
            "index": 41,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "They said they were performing at this year’s festival, and started promoting themselves all over the city.",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3028.666748046875,
            "positionY": 363.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "cbd7a84b-da17-458d-902b-405ab958e7c4",
            "index": 42,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "One day after school, we ran into them handing out free merch on the street. He really liked one of the puppets.",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3396.0,
            "positionY": 360.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "32eeb0a5-1562-4a06-9f87-73c14a16c9da",
            "index": 24,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "You don’t know? It’s the Qiqiao Festival—held in Yuntai every two years! It’s one of our city’s biggest celebrations.\r",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4890.66650390625,
            "positionY": 744.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "44cc4260-e22a-452c-b56b-aba37f3b6505",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hehe~ I used to be into that kind of thing back in college too. I even joined a local folklore club—ended up meeting this boy’s father thanks to that. Kinda romantic, right?",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5302.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f97cba86-77b1-4bd3-a5d5-8cc7fbd14b68",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "318c68cb-5927-41a5-91bd-bf8aa614ee91",
            "content": {
                "en": "...... (blushing)",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5680.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e9820597-868d-4bad-b788-9c961a85adba",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "0d2edd26-5554-47f2-b61f-99a5a0caf64b",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hahaha! Dad's embarrassed again!",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6042.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
