            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "The festival still keeps the old “craft competitions,” which is probably how strange groups like Troupe Elysium get a chance to perform.",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7787.3330078125,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d7b8d099-0365-49d4-9c94-be6796c03037",
            "index": 36,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "content": {
                "en": "What?",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5968.0,
            "positionY": 1112.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b73e8965-0d73-4282-be53-d49d8195c098",
            "index": 35,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh, then you’re in luck! It’s the perfect time to visit. Hope you have a great time here!",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5302.0,
            "positionY": 1112.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c2dede75-e955-4826-b87d-e4a6610303ce",
            "index": 46,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "content": {
                "en": "Just so you know—Yuntai always goes into lockdown for the three days of the festival. Did your friend mention that to you?",
                "zh": "",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5637.3330078125,
            "positionY": 1108.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
